      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Pre-Clarke — Validator Status (on-chain, epoch 0)\nPre-Clarke runs on the **Bradbury chain (chainId 4221)** with a separate consensus deployment; **no portal roster** exists, so validators come straight from the **chain indexer** (explorer API) and are cross-checked against **Grafana telemetry**. New validators show **pending / primed (next epoch)** until the next epoch boundary, then go **active**. **Metrics/Logs**: ON = node reporting last 5m, SHAME = active but silent, - = not applicable (not active yet). Source: internal-explorer.genlayer.com."
      }
